<title>SPAIN: Spain Pryca sales Jan-May down 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Pryca sales Jan-May down 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket group Pryca gross sales were 226.2 billion pesetas in the first five months of the year, down 0.5 percent from the same period a year earlier, the firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In May alone sales were 46.3 billion pesetas compared with 45.1 billion in April.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
